\pard\b\fs20 Suny Isles\b0\par
\fs16\par
The map is a large multiplayer melee under water.\par
The central elements of this round are the weapons developed for underwater warfare and the biotechnically modified fish.\par
The winding underwater landscape invites surprise attacks on the enemy from ambush, while your own settlement lies well hidden in deep underwater caves.\par
